# Line endings.
#
# Files that leave this repository to be EXECUTED somewhere else — the phone
# (Termux/Android /bin/sh), a GPU host, a Kaggle kernel — must be checked out
# with LF regardless of platform. A Windows checkout under core.autocrlf=true
# writes CRLF, and Android's /bin/sh then fails on the first blank line
# ("g0_probe.sh: 12: : not found") and on every backslash continuation
# ("Syntax error: word unexpected"). Observed 2026-09-14 on the OnePlus 15R.
moe-phone/device/**   text eol=lf
*.sh                  text eol=lf
*.ipynb               text eol=lf
